Backported to mpv v0.41.0 from upstream commits:
  c66204b69ba201cf6611daae7e515442eed4b9cd screenshot: correctly detect hardware frame
  4bbf014f098b52ea3888812f8738ad3016d89501 sub/draw_bmp: fix rgba alpha blending
  fdb996adbc49b705268528b2ad1c3b2cdf23618f sd_ass: clear num_packets_animated on every reset
  9ccd8899ff28c4f6bdd113026d307af3d46133c5 sub/draw_bmp: limit memset to available width in last slice
  09900a0ff016c24409a4e6f95012260ed1107d7e demux/packet_pool: incrementally free old packets on pop
  6bdacac99153b5a487d108e11d2f8d7678afd2fd player/loadfile: fix stack-overflow on EDL metadata track
  74271a7d80f6c59185699d0d6d2d0b64bcbe90ae sub/sd_ass: subtitle timing rounding errors
  fb5345809dc7fef8d40ee27c8e21d931314c9e3a sub/sd_ass: fix animated state indexing for reordered packets
  7bc56a77a9e4d24d0ea20af9a1c97d9a7a764232 bitmap_packer: return -1 instead of aborting on invalid bitmap size
  48e6c35c0e056d9e4ff04b98e012416697736d8a demux: interrupt blocking reads whose result would be discarded
  19aaa33a860794338847f0d24e5e409307a6a6b2 sd_ass: keep the seen and animated state on the original packet
  f71da2a9a5a9c758eb05e575bc05571cfaf53f6d sub/sd_ass: deduplicate packets without file position by content hash

TLS verification is enabled explicitly in the 0.41 stream_lavf defaults,
using the existing FFmpeg SecureTransport/SChannel system trust stores.
Packet pool cleanup retains 0.41 AVPacket and talloc cleanup semantics.
HLS cancellation is adapted to the 0.41 demuxer retry loop.

